.TH GSEA 2 2000-1月 "cast_enrichs" "cast_enrichs"
.SH NAME
cast_enrichs \- Create the GCModeller enrichment analysis result objects from the raw data vectors.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fIcast_enrichs(\fBterm\fR as string, 
\fBname\fR as string, 
\fBpvalue\fR as double, 
\fBgeneIDs\fR as list = \fB<NULL>\fR, 
\fBdesc\fR as string = \fB<NULL>\fR, 
\fBscore\fR as double = \fB<NULL>\fR, 
\fBfdr\fR as double = \fB<NULL>\fR, 
\fBcluster\fR as integer = \fB<NULL>\fR, 
\fBenriched\fR as string = \fB<NULL>\fR, 
[\fB<Environment>\fR]);\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Create the GCModeller enrichment analysis result objects from the raw data vectors.
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fBterm\fB \fR\- the term id vector.. 
.PP
.PP
\fBname\fB \fR\- the term name vector, its length should be equals to the \fBterm\fR vector.. 
.PP
.PP
\fBpvalue\fB \fR\- the p-value vector of each term.. 
.PP
.PP
\fBgeneIDs\fB \fR\- 
 a named list of the member gene id vector of each term, the name of the list slot
 should be the term id. Default \fBNULL\fR means no member gene id.
. 
.PP
.PP
\fBdesc\fB \fR\- the description vector of each term. Default \fBNULL\fR.. 
.PP
.PP
\fBscore\fB \fR\- the enrichment score vector of each term. Default \fBNULL\fR.. 
.PP
.PP
\fBfdr\fB \fR\- the adjusted p-value (FDR) vector of each term. Default \fBNULL\fR.. 
.PP
.PP
\fBcluster\fB \fR\- the cluster size vector of each term. Default \fBNULL\fR.. 
.PP
.PP
\fBenriched\fB \fR\- the enriched gene id vector joined by \fB;\fR of each term. Default \fBNULL\fR.. 
.PP
.PP
\fBenv\fB \fR\- the R# runtime environment.. 
.PP
.SH VALUE
.PP
an array of the [EnrichmentResult](cref:T:SMRUCC.genomics.Analysis.HTS.GSEA.EnrichmentResult) objects.
.PP
.SH SEE ALSO
GSEA
.SH FILES
.PP
gseakit.dll
.PP
